OL,3,AAmericans head to the polls for
OL,4,Aelections that could define Trump's
OL,5,Aclosing chapter
OL,6,
OL,7,FWith two years of his presidency
OL,8,Fremaining, Donald Trump, who has
OL,9,Fdominated American politics over the
OL,10,Fpast decade and transformed it in
OL,11,Fremarkable ways, is facing potentially
OL,12,Fpivotal elections.
OL,14,FAnd the midterm elections on Tuesday
OL,15,Fthat will decide control of Congress
OL,16,Fcome at a difficult moment for his
OL,17,FRepublican Party.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
