OL,3,AAmericans head to the polls for
OL,4,Aelections that could define Trump's
OL,5,Aclosing chapter
OL,6,
OL,7,FVoters overwhelmingly say they are most
OL,8,Fconcerned about the cost of living.
OL,9,FFood and fuel prices have soared in
OL,10,Fpart due to the president's aggressive
OL,11,Ftariffs and unpopular war with Iran, so
OL,12,Fit will be top of mind as many head to
OL,13,Fthe polls.
OL,15,FTrump, who has faced record low
OL,16,Fapproval ratings in recent months, has
OL,17,Fbeen campaigning hard, headlining
OL,18,Fdozens of rallies across the country.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
